    "body": "So this succeeds when A1 embeds A2. It does not succeed when A1 embeds B. It also succeeds when A1 embeds A2 and A2 redirects to B which redirects to A3. That case seems concerning.\r\n\r\nThis should probably also use \"redirect-tainted origin\"?\r\n\r\n(This does look a lot clearer by the way, thanks!)",
